<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>ko</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_PACKAGE_TYPE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>글쇠</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>UILaunchScreen</key>
	<dict/>
	<!-- 수출 규정 선언. **법적 선언이다 — 근거 없이 건드리지 마라.**

	     2026-09-11 최초 근거("이 앱은 암호화를 아예 안 쓴다")는 Firebase 도입으로 무너졌다.
	     Firebase는 HTTPS로 서버에 보낸다. 2026-09-14에 근거를 다시 세웠고 결론은 그대로 false다.

	     애플 공식 문서(Complying with Encryption Export Regulations) 원문:
	       "Set the value to NO if your app - including any third-party libraries it links
	        against - doesn't use encryption, **or if it only uses forms of encryption that are
	        exempt from export compliance documentation requirements.**"
	       "Typically, the use of encryption that's built into the operating system - for
	        example, when your app makes HTTPS connections using URLSession - is exempt from
	        export documentation upload requirements, whereas the use of proprietary
	        encryption is not."
	     App Store Connect Help도 같다: "Your app uses encryption limited to that within the
	     Apple operating system - No documentation required in App Store Connect."

	     우리가 그 면제 조건에 든다는 실측(빌드 산출물, 2026-09-14):
	       - 번들에 암호화 라이브러리가 없다. 프레임워크는 FirebaseAnalytics /
	         GoogleAppMeasurement 둘뿐이고 BoringSSL·OpenSSL류는 실리지 않는다
	         (Firestore/gRPC를 안 쓰므로 openssl_grpc 경로가 없다).
	       - 앱 바이너리의 암호 관련 미해결 심볼은 _CC_MD5 / _CC_SHA1 / _CC_SHA256 /
	         _CC_SHA384 뿐 — 전부 OS의 CommonCrypto 해시이고 애초에 암호화가 아니다.
	       - 링크된 것은 Security.framework 등 OS 프레임워크뿐. 네트워크는 NSURLSession(OS HTTPS).
	     => 자체 암호화 구현 없음, OS 제공 HTTPS/TLS만 사용 => 면제. false 유지가 맞다.

	     ⚠️ 다만 근거가 "암호화 없음"에서 "면제되는 암호화만 사용"으로 바뀌었다. 애플 문서는
	       "If your app uses exempt forms of encryption, you might alternatively be required to
	        submit a year-end self-classification report to the U.S. government."
	     이라고 덧붙인다. 이건 코드가 아니라 행정·법무 판단이다 — 사장님 확인 대상.
	     상세: docs/release/firebase-on-hardening.md -->
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations~ipad</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortraitUpsideDown</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
